# The clock (cavekit-flash.md R7): it takes no input; its task is to keep the time, so its picture must move on by
# itself, and again.
id: flash-app-clock
section: Flash
item: A Flash app does its task, the clock: its hands move on by themselves, twice in a row, with no input
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8097/title/flash-clock
kit: cavekit-flash.md R7
wait rect m 40
expect flash-drawn m yes
sample a m
wait differs m a 5
sample b m
wait differs m b 5
expect region-changed m b
